  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 179, 'Request written instructions at your next appointment, so you do not need to remember everything on the spot.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 180, 'Stop for a moment outside the exam room, notice you are already on the other side of it, and let that sink in.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 181, 'Sit in the passenger seat while someone you trust drives your road test route, and simply notice the turns and signs.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 182, 'Allow your belly to soften instead of holding it in, and take one easy breath all the way down.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 183, 'Put your worry into a single sentence, then ask, "Will this matter in a year?" and write your honest answer.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 184, 'Practice introducing yourself to a friend as if meeting for the first time, with a smile and your full name.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 185, 'Open the curtains first thing the morning after a big moment and notice that a new day has begun.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 186, 'Learn how the day of a road test or exam will run, from check in to finish, so each step feels expected.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 187, 'Twist gently from side to side in your chair a few times, letting your gaze travel with you.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 188, 'Remember that a few seconds of silence feel much longer to you than to anyone listening, so you can pause freely.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 189, 'Call a relative you have not spoken to in a while and simply catch up, an easy warm up for longer conversations.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 190, 'Look back at the end of a first day at a new job and pick out one person who made you feel welcome.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 191, 'Draw two columns on a page: what you can control about your next big moment, and what you can let go of.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 192, 'Notice the temperature of the air as it enters your nose while you wait, cool on the way in and warmer on the way out.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 193, 'Imagine walking out of the dentist''s office into fresh air, feeling lighter, and let that picture stay a moment.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 194, 'Get a friend to quiz you gently with flash cards the evening before a test, then stop and do something fun.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 195, 'List the small steps that got you to the door of your last appointment, from waking up to walking in.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 196, 'Open your slides on a different screen the day before a presentation, to check they look the way you expect.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 197, 'Rub the base of your neck gently with your fingertips before you head into a meeting.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 198, 'Breathe in while thinking "I am here," breathe out while thinking "I am ready," for five gentle rounds.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 199, 'Confide in a trusted coworker that you feel a little nervous about your presentation, and let them reassure you.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 200, 'Rest your eyes and your voice after a performance, and save any review of it for the next morning.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 201, 'Choose a simple breakfast you know sits well with you, and get it ready the night before a big morning.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 202, 'Yawn on purpose, or let one come, and notice how your face and throat loosen.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 203, 'Pick one thing you are genuinely curious about in your next presentation, like a question the audience might ask, and look forward to it.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 204, 'Go with a friend to a free public talk or reading nearby, and notice how relaxed the speaker seems even when they pause.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 205, 'Look for one moment during a recent interview where you felt steady, and remember exactly what you were doing.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 206, 'Tuck a spare copy of your notes or resume into a second pocket of your bag, just in case.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 207, 'Shake out each leg in turn before you stand up for an exam, letting your knees and ankles go loose.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 208, 'Remember that most people you meet are thinking about their own nerves, not judging yours, and let that ease you.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 209, 'Phone a friend for a five minute chat before you head into a hard conversation, just to hear a warm voice.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 210, 'Allow yourself to feel tired after a big moment, and see tiredness as a sign you gave it your effort.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 211, 'Spend ten minutes tonight tidying the spot where you will get ready tomorrow, so the morning feels clear.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 212, 'Cup your hands over your eyes for a few breaths to rest them before you present.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 213, 'Try saying "and" instead of "but" about your nerves today, as in "I feel nervous, and I am ready."'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 214, 'Agree with a support person on one thing they can do if you need a pause, like asking for water.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 215, 'Write a short paragraph about your biggest moment this season, as if you were telling a friend the story.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 216, 'Clear one small chore off your list for the day of your big moment, so it has a little more room around it.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 217, 'Count your out breaths from one to five, then start again, while you wait to be called.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 218, 'Decide in advance what you will tell yourself if you stumble on a word: "That''s fine, I''ll keep going."'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 219, 'Raise one simple question in a group setting this autumn, as practice for speaking up later.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 220, 'Ask a friend who was there what they noticed you did well, and write their words in your notebook.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 221, 'Check whether the place you are going has stairs, an elevator or a side entrance, so getting inside feels simple.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 222, 'Interlace your fingers, turn your palms away from you and push gently forward to stretch your arms and upper back.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 223, 'Ask what the very worst outcome would truly be, then write how you would cope with it, step by step.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 224, 'Run a mock meeting with a friend where you practice saying "I''d like to add something" and then making your point.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 225, 'Pick a calm spot at home for after big moments, like a chair by a window, and sit there tonight.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 226, 'Let one trusted person know when your next big moment is, so someone is quietly cheering you on.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 227, 'Massage the space between your thumb and first finger with your other hand while you sit.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 228, 'Turn the volume down on a harsh inner voice by repeating its words in a silly cartoon voice, just once.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 229, 'Let the interviewer know you would like to take a note while you answer, and practice asking with a friend.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 230, 'Plant a few seeds or a small pot of herbs in spring after a big moment, something new to tend as life carries on.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 231, 'Email whoever invited you to an interview or meeting to ask what the format will be, so you know what to expect.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 232, 'Feel the air on your skin as you walk in for your first day somewhere new, warm or cool.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 233, 'Let your nerves be there while you do one ordinary task, like folding laundry, without needing them to leave.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 234, 'Seek out someone who has started at your new school or job and ask what the first day was really like.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 235, 'Note what time of day your nerves eased after a recent appointment, and plan something gentle for that time next time.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 236, 'Create a one page sheet of names, times and addresses for your next big day, and keep it with your things.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 237, 'Stand up and walk slowly around the room while you take a phone call that matters, if moving helps you think.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 238, 'Hear the words "You may begin" in your mind, as at an exam, then see yourself reading the first question calmly.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 239, 'Hand your list of questions to the doctor at the start of the visit so nothing gets forgotten.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 240, 'Give your mind a rest after a presentation by reading a few pages of something you love, far from the topic.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 241, 'In autumn, look up what time it gets dark on your big day, and plan a well lit way home if you will be out late.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 242, 'On the bus or train to something big, feel the gentle sway of the ride and let your body move with it instead of bracing.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 243, 'Thank your mind for trying to protect you when worries pop up, and say, "I''ve got this part from here."'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 244, 'Pick a person you trust to read your cover letter or speech notes, and ask which part sounds most like you.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 245, 'List any loose ends from a big meeting on one page, so you can stop holding them in your head tonight.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 246, 'As spring weather changes quickly, pack a light layer you can add or take off before your next big moment.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 247, 'Gently squeeze each earlobe between thumb and finger, then give it a small, soft tug.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 248, 'Ask yourself before bed what would help most right now, and do that one small thing before you turn off the light.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 249, 'Repeat back what someone said in a conversation today, in your own words, as practice for staying with them when it matters.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 250, 'Recall one kind thing someone said to you during a hard conversation, and let it settle in.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 251, 'Shape a warm closing line for the end of your next interview or meeting, so you know how you will say goodbye.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 252, 'Run your fingertips over something with texture while you wait at the dentist, like the seam of your sleeve or a knit cuff.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 253, 'Recall someone you admire who gets nervous too, and remind yourself that nerves and courage often travel together.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 254, 'Arrange a buddy for a new class this fall, so you can walk in together on the first day.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 255, 'Thank your body for carrying you through a nervous moment, from your racing heart to your steady feet.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 256, 'Plan to find the restroom first when you arrive somewhere new, so you know where to step away for a quiet minute.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 257, 'Rock gently from heel to toe a few times while you stand waiting, then come to stillness.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 258, 'Choose to see your first day at a new class this fall as a chance to learn names, not a test to pass.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 259, 'Tell a friend one thing you are proud of in your preparation, and let them cheer you on.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 260, 'Keep a small token from a moment you handled, like a name badge or a ticket stub, in a box of good memories.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 261, 'Record yourself giving a short answer to a common interview question, and listen back with kindness.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 262, 'Circle your wrists and ankles slowly before a performance to wake your body up softly.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 263, 'Remind yourself that you are allowed to ask someone to repeat a question, in any conversation big or small.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 264, 'Stand in front of a few friends and tell a short story you enjoy, easy practice being the one everyone looks at.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 265, 'Put away your exam books where you cannot see them for the evening, so your mind can clock off too.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 266, 'Schedule a gentle reminder for when to leave, so you are not watching the clock all morning.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 267, 'Wrap yourself in a warm scarf or sweater on a chilly autumn morning, and enjoy the comfort of the warmth.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 268, 'Note three things that are going well right now, even small ones, to balance the worry in your head.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 269, 'Write a short good luck note for a friend facing their own big moment, and leave it where they will find it.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 270, 'Hug someone you love when you get home after a big day, and let it last a few seconds longer than usual.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 271, 'Have a short, honest line ready in case your mind goes blank, like "Let me take a moment to think about that."'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 272, 'Smell something fresh, like a cut lemon or clean laundry, and take one slow breath in.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 273, 'Visualize stepping onto a stage, feeling the warm lights, and hearing your first word or note come out clear and steady.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 274, 'Rehearse your toast or speech for a family gathering with one relative before the event.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 275, 'Wonder aloud with a friend about something completely unrelated after an appointment, like a trip you would love to take.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 276, 'Imagine the room you will be in, and decide where you might put your bag and coat when you arrive.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 277, 'Hang your arms loose at your sides for a moment before you knock on the door.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 278, 'On a gray winter afternoon, doodle freely on a page for five minutes and let your thoughts wander without steering them.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 279, 'Request a seat near the door at a performance or class, if that helps you feel more settled.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 280, 'Make your bed fresh with clean sheets on the evening after a big interview, ready for a good night''s rest.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 281, 'Mark the one item on a meeting agenda where you most want to speak, and note a sentence to start with.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 282, 'Puff your cheeks full of air, hold it for a moment, then let it go with a soft pop.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 283, 'See your appointment as just one small part of a whole day, with a walk and a quiet evening after it.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 284, 'Swap phone numbers with a classmate before a big shared day, like an exam, so you can check in with each other.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 285, 'Take in the applause or thanks at the end of a performance, instead of brushing it away or picking at mistakes.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 286, 'Tuck one small comforting item, like a smooth stone or a photo, into your pocket for the big day.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 287, 'March softly in place at home in the morning for half a minute, letting your arms move naturally.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 288, 'Label a busy thought as "planning" or "worrying" today, and if it is worrying, kindly set it down.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 289, 'Share your plan for a big day with a friend, including how you will get there and what you will do after.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 290, 'Read back the worries you wrote before a big moment, and cross off the ones that never happened.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 291, 'Decide on a time to stop preparing the evening before a big moment, and write it down so you know when you are done.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 292, 'Lie on your back on the floor at home for a few minutes before you leave, knees bent and feet flat.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 293, 'Add the words "I have done hard things before" to the first page of your notes for an upcoming meeting.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 294, 'Answer "Tell me about yourself" for a friend in under a minute, then try it once more with a smile.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 295, 'Choose a soft song for the bus or train ride home after your next big day, and listen with your eyes on the view.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 296, 'Polish or wipe down the shoes you plan to wear for your next big moment, a small, calm task for an ordinary evening.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 297, 'Lower your voice a little and speak slowly to yourself as you get ready, to set a calm pace.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 298, 'Think of your nerves as a wave at the beach on a summer day, rising, peaking and then rolling back out.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 299, 'Invite a friend to sit in on a practice run of your class presentation, and ask for one tip, not ten.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 300, 'Dance loosely to one upbeat song in your kitchen after a big day, letting the leftover nerves shake out.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 301, 'Write your notes as a few words per point rather than full sentences, so you can speak naturally instead of reading.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 302, 'Tap your fingertips lightly on your collarbones for a few breaths before a big conversation.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 303, 'Promise yourself that whatever happens in your next interview, you will speak to yourself kindly afterward.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 304, 'Mention to a friend one thing you would like help with on a big morning, like a ride or a wake up call.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 305, 'Capture one surprise from a recent big moment in a sentence, something you did not expect that turned out fine.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 306, 'Write down what you hope the other person will understand before a hard conversation, in one or two lines.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 307, 'Let your arms float up slowly in front of you as you breathe in, and lower them as you breathe out.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 308, 'Let a busy mind settle with a small puzzle, like a word game on paper, for five minutes before you start getting ready.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 309, 'Encourage a family member to share a time they felt nervous and how it turned out, over dinner tonight.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 310, 'Let a disappointing moment be just one chapter, and write one sentence about what you would like the next to hold.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 311, 'Name one thing you are looking forward to about your next big moment, however small, and write it down.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 312, 'Pause in the doorway and take one slow breath before you walk into a room full of new people.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 313, 'Picture someone who loves you standing beside you as you walk into your next appointment.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 314, 'Play a simple card or board game with friends or family, a relaxed way to practice chatting and laughing in a group.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 315, 'Draw a small star beside each moment on your list that you once thought you could not do.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 316, 'Gather small comforts for a long wait: a book, a sweater, a pen and paper.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 317, 'Ease a tight watch or collar a little while you wait, so your body can settle.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 318, 'Move your attention to your hands when a worry loops, noticing their warmth and weight, then go back to your task.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 319, 'Thank a teacher, coach or leader after a class or event, a short word that gets you used to speaking to people in charge.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 320, 'Tell the sky or an empty room how your big day went, out loud and without editing a word.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 321, 'Prepare an answer to "Why do you want this?" in a few honest sentences, so it is ready before your next interview.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 322, 'Rest your gaze on something far away, like a tree or the sky, for a few breaths.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 323, 'Spend two minutes thinking about what you would like to learn from your next meeting with new coworkers, not only how you will come across.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 324, 'Bring a friend to a gathering where you will meet new people, and agree you can step outside together.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 325, 'Clear a little space in your calendar for the day after something big, so you have room to recover your energy.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 326, 'Lay a blank page over your notes and write the main ideas from memory, then check gently for anything you missed.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 327, 'Roll a pen slowly between your palms while you wait, letting the motion soothe your hands.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 328, 'Give yourself permission to not have every answer ready, and write "I can say I''ll find out" in your notes.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 329, 'Teach a friend something small you know well on an autumn afternoon, like a card trick or a recipe, as practice explaining out loud.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 330, 'Let a stressful winter appointment be followed by something cheerful, like hanging lights in a window.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 331, 'Before a big holiday gathering, decide how long you plan to stay and how you will get home, so the evening has a clear shape.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 332, 'Bend into a gentle forward fold at home before you leave, letting your head and arms hang.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 333, 'Look back on the last time a big moment came and went, and notice how quickly the hard part passed.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 334, 'Open a practice talk by asking your listeners a question, so the room feels more like a conversation.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 335, 'Brush your teeth and wash your face slowly on the night after meeting new people, a calm way to close a social day.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 336, 'Ask for any forms ahead of time and fill them in at home, so your appointment starts without a clipboard rush.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 337, 'Massage your scalp with your fingertips in small circles for a few seconds before you head out.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 338, 'Write a short list of things that are true about you no matter how your next big moment goes.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 339, 'Introduce yourself at the exam desk as new to this place, and ask where you should wait.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 340, 'Choose one word for how you want to feel by bedtime after a big day, and pick one small thing that leads there.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 341, 'Make a backup plan for getting there, like a second bus or a friend''s ride, in case the first one falls through.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 342, 'Sit by a window for a few minutes before an evening event and watch the light fade, letting your body slow with it.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 343, 'Decide what you would like to remember about your first day somewhere new, like one name or one kind moment, and look for it.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 344, 'Offer to help a friend rehearse for their big moment, and notice how you learn from watching them.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 345, 'Pause before replying to anyone who asks how it went, and choose how much you want to share for now.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 346, 'Read your notes once in the evening, then close them and trust that you know more than you think.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 347, 'Soften your knees slightly as you stand at the front of a room, so your legs stay relaxed.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 348, 'Remind yourself before an exam that you can skip a hard question and come back, and that this is allowed.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 349, 'Remember one detail someone shares with you today and mention it next time you see them, a small, warm way to connect.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 350, 'Rest your feet up for a while after a long exam day, and let your mind wander anywhere it likes.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 351, 'Learn the rough schedule of your first day at a new place, like when breaks are, so the hours have a shape.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 352, 'Exhale fully before you answer a question, then breathe in and begin.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 353, 'Repeat a calming line on your commute, like "One thing at a time," each time you stop at a light or a station.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 354, 'Join a small group activity this winter, like a class at a library, as gentle practice in meeting people.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 355, 'Remind yourself that how a moment felt and how it actually went can be two different things, and both are worth noticing.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 356, 'Walk into a room at home, smile and say hello out loud, so the first moment of your big day feels familiar.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 357, 'Stand tall with your hands on your hips for a minute in a quiet spot, chin level, before a big conversation.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 358, 'Consider what advice your younger self would need before a big moment, and give that advice to yourself today.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 359, 'Leave a voicemail on purpose for a friend today, as easy practice for speaking without a script.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 360, 'Return a kind message to the person you had a hard conversation with, if it feels right, like "Thanks for listening."'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 361, 'Before a summer event outdoors, find out if there will be shade and seats, so you can plan where to rest.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 362, 'Stretch out long in bed the night before something big, reaching your arms past your head and pointing your toes, then go soft.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 363, 'Picture yourself at the end of your next big conversation, shoulders relaxed, glad you said what mattered.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 364, 'Sit with a friend in easy silence for a few minutes, a reminder that company does not always need words.'),
  ('finding-calm-before-big-moments', 365, 'Honor the people who will face big moments after you, by passing on one thing that helped you.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 1, 'Look out your nearest window, find one tree, near or far, and watch it quietly for a minute.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 2, 'Step outside your door and find the tree closest to where you live, even a small one, and stand near it for a quiet moment.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 3, 'Name three things you already enjoy about trees, like their shade, their colors or the sound of their leaves.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 4, 'Stretch your arms up slowly like the branches of a tree, then let them drift down with a long breath out.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 5, 'Smile at a tree on your way somewhere today and silently thank it for the shade or green it gives.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 6, 'Rest your palm on the trunk of a street tree and notice whether the bark feels rough, smooth, cool or warm.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 7, 'Walk slowly along a tree lined street at your own pace and choose the one tree you would most like to live beside.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 8, 'Discover the common name of the tree you pass most often, by asking a neighbor, gardener or librarian who knows trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 9, 'Rest your back against the trunk of a sturdy tree on a calm day, after checking above for loose or broken branches.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 10, 'Water a young street tree during a dry spell with a bucket or watering can, only where your town allows it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 11, 'Pick up one fallen leaf and trace its outline with a fingertip, feeling the edges and the veins.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 12, 'Choose a short marked trail in the woods in daylight, tell someone where you''re going, and stay on the path the whole way.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 13, 'Borrow a tree guide from the library and spend a few minutes with the pages for trees in your area.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 14, 'Breathe in slowly while watching leaves move in a light breeze, and breathe out as they settle again.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 15, 'Find out whether a community tree planting is happening near you and sign up to join in.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 16, 'Stand still outdoors with your eyes closed for a minute and listen for wind moving through branches.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 17, 'Visit a botanical garden or arboretum on a free admission day and find one tree you''ve never seen before.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 18, 'Look closely at one leaf on a low branch, without picking it, and notice whether its edge is smooth, toothed or wavy.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 19, 'Settle beside a potted tree or big leafy houseplant at home or work and give it one calm minute of your attention.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 20, 'Pick up litter from under a tree in your neighborhood while wearing gloves, leaving anything sharp for the city to collect.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 21, 'On a hot afternoon, step into the shade of a tree and feel how much cooler the air is there.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 22, 'Eat your lunch on a bench near trees instead of at your desk, and look up between bites.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 23, 'Find out which kinds of trees your town most often plants along its streets, by asking the parks office or reading its notices.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 24, 'Write a short letter to a tree you love, telling it what it has meant to you.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 25, 'Thank a park worker you see caring for trees with a few kind words.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 26, 'Gaze up at bare branches against a winter sky and follow one from the trunk out to its tip.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 27, 'Ask a neighbor or librarian where the biggest tree in your area is, then plan a daytime visit.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 28, 'Discover how a tree can tell up from down, sending its roots one way and its shoots the other, in a short library read.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 29, 'Watch a tree at dusk as the birds go quiet, and let your own body slow down along with the evening.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 30, 'Take a child you care for to see a tree on your street, staying right beside them, and help them notice its bark and leaves.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 31, 'In early spring, find one twig within easy reach and study its buds closely without picking any.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 32, 'Stroll through a cemetery quietly and respectfully in daylight and pause beside one of its old trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 33, 'Read a short poem about a tree, then spend a minute looking at a real one.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 34, 'Notice how you feel before a short walk among trees, then check in again afterward, without judging either feeling.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 35, 'Send a friend a photo of a tree you love with a short note about why it matters to you.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 36, 'Choose a tree you pass often and keep an eye on which of its leaves turn color first this fall.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 37, 'Wander the open grounds of a school or college campus during public hours and find the tree people seem to gather under.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 38, 'Ask an older relative or neighbor which trees they remember from the place where they grew up.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 39, 'Make a tiny collage of tree shapes cut from old magazines or scrap paper, just for the pleasure of it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 40, 'Learn who to call about a damaged or fallen tree on public land, and save the number in your phone.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 41, 'Watch a tree''s shadow on the ground for a few minutes and see how it shifts as the sun moves.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 42, 'Before a wooded walk, check the forecast and skip it if storms, lightning or strong winds are expected.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 43, 'Compare a young spring leaf with a late summer one on the same low branch, noticing how much thicker and darker it has grown.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 44, 'Close your eyes and picture walking slowly through a quiet woods, noticing each tree as you pass it in your mind.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 45, 'Press a fallen leaf from a tree you know between the pages of a heavy book as a keepsake.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 46, 'Spot a place where roots have lifted a sidewalk and picture how far they spread underground.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 47, 'After a walk in the woods or tall grass, check your skin, hair and clothes for ticks.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 48, 'Look up how leaves make food from sunlight, air and water, then look at a sunlit leaf with that in mind.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 49, 'Let your feet sink into the grass beside a tree on a mild, dry day, standing still and steady for a minute.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 50, 'Tell a neighbor about a tree on your street that looks especially lovely this season.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 51, 'Sketch the outline of one tree on scrap paper, no skill needed, just the rough shape of it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 52, 'Plan a morning visit to a park with trees before the rest of the day gets busy.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 53, 'Watch one tree from a comfortable distance for five minutes and notice any birds or insects that visit it, without going closer.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 54, 'Stand on a marked path in a park and slowly turn in a full circle, resting your eyes on each tree you face.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 55, 'Report a broken branch hanging over a sidewalk to your city instead of trying to move it yourself.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 56, 'Count how many different trees you can see from one window at home or at work.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 57, 'Tour a public garden greenhouse or conservatory in winter and spend a few minutes with the trees growing indoors.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 58, 'Uncover how fungi and tree roots trade food underground, then picture that hidden network as you pass a stand of trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 59, 'Match your breathing to the slow movement of leaf shadows on a wall or the ground.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 60, 'Leave the fallen leaves under a tree in your own yard this fall, where local rules allow, so they can return to the soil.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 61, 'Smell the air near a pine or other evergreen on a warm day and notice what it reminds you of.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 62, 'Bring a friend or family member along to sit under a favorite tree and talk for a while.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 63, 'Explain in your own words why leaves turn color in autumn, after reading a page about it in a library book.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 64, 'Watch clouds drift behind the top of a tree for a few minutes, letting your thoughts drift by with them.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 65, 'Ask your town how residents can request a new street tree for a bare spot.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 66, 'Compare the bark on two different trees near you and describe the difference in a few words.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 67, 'Glance up before you sit under any tree and pick a spot away from dead or hanging branches.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 68, 'Guess whether a wooden table or chair at home is hardwood or softwood, after finding out the difference between the two.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 69, 'Take slow, close photos of a tree''s bark, buds or leaves, seeing each one as a small painting.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 70, 'Steer your dog, if you have one, away from the base of young street trees on walks so their bark and soil stay healthy.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 71, 'Listen to rain falling on leaves from a sheltered spot, such as a porch, a doorway or an open window.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 72, 'Return to the same park tree in each season this year and notice how the visit feels each time.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 73, 'Study the bark on a young tree and an old one on your walk, and notice how the texture changes with age.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 74, 'Enjoy the hush of a tree lined street early in the morning, before most people are up.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 75, 'Make a small card with a pressed leaf on the front and give it to someone who could use a lift.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 76, 'Take a photo of the tree outside your window so you can compare it in a later season.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 77, 'Attend an outdoor concert or movie held under trees in a park, and look up at them between songs.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 78, 'Examine a thorny tree from a step away, after reading why some trees grow thorns, without touching it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 79, 'Draw a simple sound map while sitting near a tree, marking where each sound around you comes from.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 80, 'Walk with a friend to a tree you like and tell them what you have noticed about it over time.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 81, 'Notice which trees on your commute still hold their leaves after the others have gone bare.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 82, 'Bundle up on a crisp winter day and walk a short loop where bare trees line the path.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 83, 'Keep a short list of the trees you learn to recognize this year, adding a name only when you are sure of it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 84, 'Unwind in a warm bath or shower while you picture soft rain falling on a quiet forest.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 85, 'Keep your own trash cans, bikes and car doors from bumping the trunk of a young tree near your home.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 86, 'Search for a leaf shape you haven''t noticed before: lobed, needled, heart shaped or long and thin.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 87, 'Pick out a tree you can see from far off, on a hill or at the end of a road, and make a daylight trip to stand near it if it''s on public land.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 88, 'Research what sap is and why it moves through a tree in late winter, reading about it rather than tapping any tree.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 89, 'Arrange a few fallen twigs and leaves into a small pattern on the ground, then leave it for the wind to scatter.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 90, 'Remind a family member, kindly, never to carve, nail or tie anything tightly into a tree.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 91, 'During a windy storm, watch the trees from safely indoors and see how differently each one sways.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 92, 'Stop at a public tree you can reach on your commute, even if you only pause for a few breaths.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 93, 'Listen to a short radio piece or audio talk about trees while you cook, fold laundry or ride the bus.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 94, 'Picture the people who sat under an old tree before you, and feel part of a long, quiet line.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 95, 'Volunteer for an hour with a local group that looks after parks or trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 96, 'Turn over a fallen pine cone or seed pod in your hand and look at how it is put together.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 97, 'Spend part of your lunch break on a walk around the block where the most trees grow.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 98, 'Write down three words that describe the tree you see most, then learn one new word for a part of a tree.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 99, 'Fold a piece of paper into a simple tree shape or cut out a few leaves, letting your hands work slowly.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 100, 'Plant a few tree seeds from a packet in a small pot with a child, just to watch what happens together.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 101, 'Tilt your head back under a tree on a bright day and watch the light coming through the leaves.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 102, 'Read the signs at an arboretum or garden and learn the names of three trees you like.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 103, 'Learn how a tree draws water up through its roots, then look at the ground around a street tree with fresh eyes.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 104, 'Draw just the bark of a tree in close detail, noticing the lines and patterns as your pencil moves.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 105, 'Use sand instead of salt near trees on your own walkway in winter, where that still keeps the path safe.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 106, 'Find where moss or lichen grows on a trunk, and which side of the tree it seems to favor.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 107, 'Sit by a window in a library, coffee shop or waiting room that looks out on trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 108, 'Picture how a tree grows taller only from the tips of its branches, so a mark on its trunk stays at the same height for life.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 109, 'Pick one calm word to say to yourself each time you pass a tree on a walk, such as easy, steady or slow.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 110, 'Write a short note to your city council or parks department saying how much you value the trees near you.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 111, 'After a snowfall, notice how the snow settles along the branches of a tree near your home.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 112, 'Study a park map before you go and pick the corner with the most trees as the goal of your visit.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 113, 'Puzzle out what the word canopy means for a tree, then look up into one from a safe spot on the sidewalk.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 114, 'Color a simple tree outline with whatever pencils or crayons you have, using slow, calm strokes.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 115, 'Teach someone the name of a tree you learned recently, and point one out if it grows nearby.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 116, 'See how much darker a trunk looks when it is soaked with rain, and how it pales again as it dries.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 117, 'Venture out to a stand of trees after the first frost and listen to how quiet it is there.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 118, 'Check whether your town keeps a list of notable or heritage trees, and read about one of them.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 119, 'Listen to a piece of quiet music in the shade of a tree, giving it your full attention from start to finish.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 120, 'Reuse a paper bag or cardboard box one more time today, with a quiet thought for the trees it came from.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 121, 'Watch on a spring morning for the first tiny leaves opening, often a pale, almost yellow green.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 122, 'Walk a public road or path beside a row of farm windbreak trees and notice whether the wind feels different behind them.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 123, 'Wonder how each seed travels as you see trees drop winged seeds, round ones or pods in late summer and fall.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 124, 'Watch snow drop from a branch in a soft puff as the day warms, and smile at the small surprise of it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 125, 'Keep a reusable cup or bottle with you on park walks so there is less litter to end up among the trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 126, 'Slow your steps on a fall walk so you can hear the dry leaves crunch under your feet.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 127, 'Stick to public paths and parks when visiting trees, never a private yard or fenced land.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 128, 'Dig into which trees around you are native to your region and which were brought from elsewhere, using a library guide.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 129, 'Gaze at a tree through a window at work for one minute whenever you feel rushed.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 130, 'Keep the trunk of a street tree near you clear of old fliers and tape by gently peeling off what is stuck to it, never the bark.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 131, 'Pause at a bus stop, parking lot or schoolyard and find the nearest tree before you check your phone.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 132, 'Leave every tree you visit as you found it: no carving, no peeling bark and no breaking branches.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 133, 'Peek at the stump of a tree that was already cut down in a park or public place, and try counting a few of its rings.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 134, 'Step outside once a summer storm has fully passed and take in the fresh, washed look of the trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 135, 'Start a tree notebook with someone in your family, each of you adding a line whenever you notice something about a tree.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 136, 'Look at a tree at dusk and watch its colors fade until only its outline is left.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 137, 'Look around a nature center''s displays of local trees, leaves or wood for a few unhurried minutes.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 138, 'Notice the root flare where a trunk widens into the ground, and read why it matters that soil and mulch don''t bury it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 139, 'Name, in your head, five things you can see, hear or feel while standing near a tree.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 140, 'Donate gently used gloves, buckets or watering cans to a local tree or park group that can put them to use.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 141, 'Give one tree you can see every day a simple name, and say hello to it when you pass.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 142, 'Find a tree on a campus or in a park that was planted in someone''s memory, and read its plaque if it has one.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 143, 'Discover why a tall tree is the worst place to shelter in a thunderstorm, and where to go instead.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 144, 'Choose a bench or step with a view of trees for a phone call with someone you love, and enjoy both at once.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 145, 'Help a friend choose a good spot for a tree in their yard, away from the house, wires and pipes.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 146, 'Spend two minutes following how a single branch moves in a light breeze.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 147, 'Find a high spot you can reach easily, like a hill path or an upstairs window in a public building, and look out over the treetops.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 148, 'Investigate how trees cool a street with their shade and with the water that rises out through their leaves.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 149, 'Look for a heart, a face or an animal hidden in the bark or branches of a tree, just for fun.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 150, 'Draw a simple tree on a birthday card for a friend and write a wish for them in its branches.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 151, 'Scan a tree from a few steps back for signs that animals use it, like chewed cones or nut shells scattered at its base.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 152, 'Look for a pocket park or community garden with even one tree and spend ten minutes there.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 153, 'Try to recognize three trees by their winter outlines alone, after looking at pictures of their bare shapes.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 154, 'Read a few pages of a book while sitting on a bench in the shade of a tree.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 155, 'Plan a walk past the trees in your neighborhood with a new neighbor, so they feel welcome and get to know the area.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 156, 'Feel how the shade under a leafy tree differs from the shade of a building on the same street.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 157, 'Choose a seat on the bus or train on the side that passes the most trees, and look out at them on the way.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 158, 'Jot down in a notebook when the tree outside your window first shows new leaves this spring.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 159, 'Mold a small tree from clay or foil, taking your time with the trunk and the branches.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 160, 'Tell a coworker about a shady tree near work where they could take a peaceful break.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 161, 'Inspect the ground beneath a tree, whether it holds grass, bare soil, flowers or fallen needles, and how it differs from the ground nearby.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 162, 'Join a free guided tree walk if a local park, library or nature center offers one.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 163, 'Learn the difference between evergreen and deciduous trees, and see how many of each you can spot on a short walk.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 164, 'Tidy a windowsill that faces a tree so the view feels clear and calm when you sit there.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 165, 'Offer to walk an older neighbor to a bench under a tree and sit with them for a while.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 166, 'Measure a large fallen leaf against your open hand and see which one is bigger.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 167, 'Take the stairs or path up to a rooftop garden or terrace with trees, if a public building near you has one.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 168, 'Practice telling a living branch from a dead one by its buds and bark, looking only and never snapping it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 169, 'Hum softly to yourself under a tree on a calm afternoon, if no one is close by.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 170, 'Offer to help a neighbor carry fallen sticks from their walkway after a storm, only once it has fully passed.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 171, 'Breathe in the fresh smell under trees just after rain, three slow breaths in a row.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 172, 'Spend an hour in a park you know well at a time of day you never usually go, and see how its trees feel different.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 173, 'Inquire of a friend or coworker whether there is a tree they love and what kind it is.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 174, 'Find the place in your body where you feel calm while you stand near a tree, and simply let that feeling stay.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 175, 'Notice a trunk squeezed by a wire or a tight tie and let the property owner or the city know.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 176, 'Count the old nests that show up in bare winter branches, hidden all summer by leaves, looking from the ground only.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 177, 'Ride the bus or train to a park you don''t usually visit and find a tree to sit near.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 178, 'Catch a nature program about forests, then go look at a nearby tree with what you learned in mind.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 179, 'Lie on your back on a rug at home and imagine the ceiling is a canopy of leaves above you.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 180, 'Speak kindly to a child who wants to climb a tree, and show them how to admire it from the ground instead.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 181, 'Pick out the lowest branch on a tree and the highest one you can see, and notice how different they look.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 182, 'Pace around the trunk of a very large tree and count how many steps it takes.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 183, 'Check after a rain shower whether the ground right under a tree looks drier than the open lawn beside it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 184, 'Paint a tree with loose strokes of watercolor or a wet brush, and enjoy how the colors blend on their own.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 185, 'Avoid parking, stacking boxes or piling snow on the roots of a street tree near your home.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 186, 'Wonder about a hollow, a knot or a scar on a trunk, and what might have happened to the tree there.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 187, 'Leave your headphones in your pocket on a tree lined walk so you can hear the branches.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 188, 'Find the name for a tree you know in another language, perhaps from a family member or a library dictionary.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 189, 'Carry a fallen leaf from a peaceful walk in your pocket for the day, and touch it when you need a calm moment.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 190, 'Donate a book about trees you have finished to a neighborhood book exchange.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 191, 'Glance at the trees on a hillside or skyline in the distance and pick out where one kind of tree gives way to another.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 192, 'Go out on the first mild day after winter to a park and notice how many people have come to be among the trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 193, 'See whether the leaves on a low twig grow in pairs across from each other or one at a time, without touching them.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 194, 'Open your eyes slowly after a minute of rest near a tree, and see it as if for the first time.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 195, 'Read a story about trees aloud to a child, sitting together by a window with a tree view.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 196, 'Admire how a tree looks in fog or mist, softer and quieter than usual.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 197, 'Pick a tree lined path for a short walk with a family member after dinner while it is still light.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 198, 'Spend a few minutes at the library reading about some of the oldest living trees in the world.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 199, 'Plan a short, calm walk among trees for a day you expect to be busy, and protect that time.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 200, 'Make a leaf rubbing with a child, with you helping, using a fallen leaf, a sheet of paper and a crayon.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 201, 'Gather three fallen leaves of different colors in autumn and lay them side by side at home.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 202, 'Wear long sleeves and closed shoes on a woodland trail, and tuck pants into socks where ticks are common.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 203, 'Think about what a tree gives the squirrel or bird you see on it from your window: shelter, food or a lookout.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 204, 'Doodle a few leaves in the margin of a notebook during a quiet break.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 205, 'Write a thank you note to the people who planted your neighborhood''s trees long ago, and keep it somewhere safe.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 206, 'Describe to yourself the shape a tree''s crown makes: round, tall and narrow, spreading or drooping.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 207, 'Visit a tree lined pond or riverbank in daylight, staying well back from the water''s edge.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 208, 'Hunt with your eyes for a gall, the odd bump some leaves and twigs grow, after reading what makes one.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 209, 'Daydream under a tree for a few minutes with no goal, letting your mind wander wherever it likes.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 210, 'Record a minute of wind and birdsong in the trees and share it with a friend who loves the outdoors.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 211, 'Examine where a branch joins the trunk and notice the wrinkled ring of bark that often forms there.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 212, 'Head one block in each direction from your door and stop at the first tree you meet each way.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 213, 'Ask someone who has lived in your neighborhood a long time which trees were planted and which grew on their own.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 214, 'Stand in a doorway during a gentle snowfall and listen to how muffled the trees and street become.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 215, 'Draw a little map of your favorite trees nearby and give a copy to a friend who would like to visit them.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 216, 'Hunt for flowers on a tree in spring, since some are showy and some are so small they''re easy to miss.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 217, 'Amble through a park in the low gold light of an autumn evening, when the sun lights up the leaves.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 218, 'Consider how street trees cope with salt from winter roads, after a short read, and notice the trees nearest a busy road.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 219, 'Speak kindly to yourself the way you would to a young tree, giving it time and room to grow.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 220, 'Find out whether your town turns old holiday trees into mulch, and pass the details along to your neighbors.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 221, 'Which tree on your street would you miss most if it were gone? Walk past it today and notice why.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 222, 'Try a few slow, mindful steps under a canopy of trees, feeling each foot meet the ground.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 223, 'Enjoy a folktale from any culture where a tree is a character, and think about what the tree stood for.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 224, 'Spend a few minutes picking out every shade of brown and gray in a single trunk, as a calm way to slow down.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 225, 'Speak to a park worker if you see someone breaking branches, rather than stepping in yourself.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 226, 'Open a window on a quiet night and see if you can hear the leaves of a nearby tree.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 227, 'Settle on a porch or front step facing a street tree with a warm drink on a cold morning.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 228, 'Look up which tree is the official state tree where you live and whether one grows anywhere near you.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 229, 'Outline a tree in the air with one finger, slowly, in time with your breathing.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 230, 'Cheer on anyone you know who is planting a tree this season, and offer to come and see it once it is in the ground.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 231, 'Find a sapling or very young tree and notice how thin and bendy its trunk still is.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 232, 'Look for a public garden that shows small potted trees and spend a few minutes studying how each one has been shaped.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 233, 'Match the main parts of a leaf, the blade, the veins and the stem, to a leaf you see on a walk.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 234, 'Notice whether the noise of a busy street seems softer when you stand beside a large tree.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 235, 'Let the city know if a newly planted street tree has looked dry and droopy for a long while.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 236, 'Compare the color of one tree''s leaves on the top side and on the underside.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 237, 'Explore the evergreen section of an arboretum in winter, when it may be the greenest place around.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 238, 'Spot the yellow dust of tree pollen on cars or puddles in spring, after reading how it travels on the wind.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 239, 'Look at a photo of a tree on a day you cannot get outside, and imagine a breeze moving its leaves.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 240, 'Offer your favorite shady bench to someone who looks like they need a rest.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 241, 'Notice the trees in the background of a photo or painting you have at home, and what they add to the picture.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 242, 'Ride a bike slowly along a tree lined park path, stopping to look up whenever you like.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 243, 'Study how a forest regrows after a fire or a storm, and the order in which plants and young trees return.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 244, 'Set a timer for three minutes and simply watch one tree, starting again kindly whenever your mind wanders.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 245, 'Brush off your shoes before and after a woods walk so you don''t carry seeds of unwanted plants from place to place.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 246, 'Check how a tree looks the morning after a big wind, from a safe distance, and see what it let go of.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 247, 'Find a covered park shelter on a gently rainy day and watch the trees from under its roof, heading home if you hear thunder.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 248, 'Observe a city crew or tree care team at work from a safe distance, and notice how carefully they move around the tree.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 249, 'Linger a little longer than usual at a tree you love, waiting until you feel ready to move on.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 250, 'Spend a few minutes reading about a tree pest or disease found in your region, so you can spot it and report it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 251, 'Find a tree with two or more trunks rising from one base, and notice how they lean away from each other.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 252, 'Walk a short loop trail with a printed map, and turn back well before it starts to get dark.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 253, 'Test whether a plant is a tree or a large shrub by looking for a single main trunk, then try it on your street.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 254, 'Relax your face, then your jaw, then your hands while sitting near a tree, one part at a time.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 255, 'Plan a small family outing to a place with special trees, letting each person choose one to show the others.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 256, 'Write one sentence about the tree outside your window in a notebook.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 257, 'Spend a few minutes in a hospital, office or shopping center courtyard where trees have been planted.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 258, 'Browse a library book of paintings or photos of trees and notice which season each artist chose to show.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 259, 'Craft something small in leafy greens and bark browns, such as a bookmark or a woven strip of yarn.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 260, 'Stay off roped off or newly seeded ground around young trees in a park, and follow any sign that asks you to.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 261, 'Look for frost or ice clinging to a tree on a winter morning, and how it sparkles in the sun.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 262, 'Drop by a farmers market or fair held under shade trees and notice how people gather beneath them.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 263, 'Understand why heavy snow and ice can bend or break branches, and why it is wise to keep clear of a tree weighed down with them.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 264, 'Visit a quiet tree after a hard conversation and give yourself a few minutes before moving on.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 265, 'Adopt a young tree on your block in spirit with your family, keeping an eye on it whenever you pass.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 266, 'Feel the texture of a twig or a piece of bark already on the ground, leaving living trees whole.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 267, 'Explore the trees around a public pool, ball field or picnic ground on a quiet day when it is nearly empty.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 268, 'Figure out what a tree''s leaves do in a drought, after a short read, and look for signs of thirst on a hot, dry day.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 269, 'Soak up the warmth of a sunny winter day beside a bare tree, feeling the sun on your face.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 270, 'Text a friend when a tree you both pass changes color or comes into leaf, so you can enjoy it together.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 271, 'Notice how a tree in a small sidewalk pit or planter still finds room to grow.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 272, 'Return to a leafy park after all the leaves have dropped and notice how far you can now see between the trunks.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 273, 'Spin a globe or open a world map and find where the great forests grow, then think about the trees growing nearest you.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 274, 'Imagine setting each worry down at the roots of a tree as you sit quietly near it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 275, 'Invite friends to a tree story evening where each person shares a memory of a tree they have loved.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 276, 'Try to follow a single leaf all the way down as it falls on a breezy fall afternoon.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 277, 'Rest at the edge of a woods rather than going in, and watch the line where the field meets the trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 278, 'Compare an old photo of your town or street with how it looks now, and spot which trees were already there long ago.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 279, 'Shake the tension out of your arms after a long day, then stand quietly beside a tree until you feel settled.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 280, 'Ask your library whether it would host a tree talk or story hour, and offer to help spread the word.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 281, 'Keep an eye out for a tree reflected in a puddle, a shop window or a car door after rain.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 282, 'Pick a tree lined neighborhood you have never walked through and take a short daytime stroll there, staying on the sidewalk.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 283, 'Learn how tree roots help hold soil in place, then notice a slope or riverbank where trees are growing.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 284, 'Swing gently on a park swing with trees around you and watch the branches rise and fall as you move.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 285, 'Suggest to your workplace a spot where a tree could be planted or a bench placed in the shade.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 286, 'Decide which side of your street has the fuller, leafier trees, and see whether it is the side that gets more sun.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 287, 'Pass beneath a tunnel of arching trees on a park path or quiet country lane, and notice how it feels to walk under them.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 288, 'Keep an eye on a fruit tree in a public garden through the year, from blossom to fruit, and read how one becomes the other.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 289, 'Savor the earthy smell of fallen autumn leaves on a dry afternoon walk.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 290, 'Guess with someone you live with which tree on your street will leaf out first, then check together in spring.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 291, 'Pick out as many different greens as you can in the trees around you on a summer day.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 292, 'Admire any mushrooms or berries you see on a woodland walk with your eyes only, never tasting them.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 293, 'Explore what a tree nursery or seed bank does to keep young trees ready for future planting.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 294, 'Pause partway through a walk among trees, close your eyes for a moment and feel the air on your face and hands.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 295, 'Leave the wildflowers and small plants growing around a tree''s base where you find them in the woods.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 296, 'Spot a tree in a place you didn''t expect, on a rooftop, in a courtyard or between two buildings.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 297, 'Stop at a roadside rest area or park on a longer trip and take a few minutes to walk among its trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 298, 'Explore one tree that matters in a culture or tradition that is new to you, through a book or a conversation.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 299, 'Remember a happy time spent near a tree and let the memory warm you for a minute.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 300, 'Report trash dumped among trees in a park or woods to the people who look after it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 301, 'Touch only the bark and leaves you can name, and leave alone any vine or plant you don''t recognize.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 302, 'Chat with a park ranger or groundskeeper about one tree they think is special.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 303, 'Estimate the height of the tallest tree you can see from home or work by comparing it to the building beside it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 304, 'Let an evergreen tree in midwinter remind you, with its steady green, that some things stay.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 305, 'Welcome the shade of a neighbor''s tree that hangs over your yard rather than asking for it to be cut back.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 306, 'Trace the shadow a streetlight throws from a tree onto your wall or ceiling at night.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 307, 'Visit an orchard at blossom time, if one near you is open to the public, and walk between the rows.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 308, 'Talk with a gardener or neighbor about why some young trees nearby are wrapped, staked or fenced, and what each one protects against.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 309, 'Sketch a tree from memory, then go look at the real one and compare the two with kindness.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 310, 'Show a child how to look for birds or squirrels in a tree from a distance, keeping them close to you.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 311, 'Check the tree nearest your workplace during a break and find one thing that has changed.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 312, 'Circle the tree lined edge of a sports field or playground while someone you care about plays.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 313, 'Read about what a tree does through the night, then look out at a tree after dark from your window.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 314, 'Put on a coat and stand in your yard or doorway for two minutes, looking at a tree in the cold air.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 315, 'Compose a short poem about a tree in your neighborhood and share it with someone you trust.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 316, 'Check whether a tree near you leans in one direction, and guess whether wind, light or a nearby building shaped it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 317, 'Plan a short daylight visit to a nearby woods with a friend, and agree on a time to be back.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 318, 'Get to know the layers inside a trunk, from the bark to the heartwood, using a simple diagram.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 319, 'Sit in your parked car facing a few trees for two quiet minutes before heading into work or home.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 320, 'Choose a tree in a park as a meeting spot for your family or friends, so it becomes a landmark you share.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 321, 'Spy a spider web strung between twigs on a dewy morning, and admire it without touching.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 322, 'Trudge out after a fresh snowfall to a park and look for the tracks of small animals crossing between the trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 323, 'Watch from far away where birds have nested in a tree in spring, and leave the nest and the birds completely alone.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 324, 'Notice how slowly a tree changes across a season, and let that remind you that slow change is fine.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 325, 'Remind everyone in your home to stay well away from trees during lightning, storms or high wind.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 326, 'Set aside a moment to see how your window tree looks in evening light compared with the morning.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 327, 'Wander the rows of a tree farm during open hours in winter, with no need to buy anything.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 328, 'Imagine the busy life in the leaf litter under a tree, from beetles to worms, after reading a page about it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 329, 'Gaze at the tree outside your window for a calm moment while the kettle heats in the morning.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 330, 'Help an older relative look out at the trees from their window, pointing out what you see.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 331, 'Listen for tapping, chattering or chirping in the trees on a quiet morning walk, and try to find where each sound is coming from.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 332, 'Wait for a ride or a friend under a tree instead of indoors, when the weather is mild.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 333, 'Read a short biography of someone who spent their life planting or studying trees.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 334, 'Ease into a free afternoon by spending a slow hour near trees with nowhere else to be.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 335, 'Remember a tree that was cut down near you and tell someone what it meant to you.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 336, 'Linger near a tree in bloom that has a sweet scent and notice where the smell is strongest around it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 337, 'Pause at a tree outside a school, library or town hall you pass often, and notice how it frames the building.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 338, 'Borrow a children''s science book about how a tree grows from a seed, and read it slowly, even as a grown up.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 339, 'Thank your body for carrying you on a walk among trees, from your feet to your lungs.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 340, 'Choose a smooth, paved, tree lined path for a walk with someone who moves slowly or uses a wheelchair.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 341, 'Study a tree that has been pruned or cut back and see how it has kept on growing.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 342, 'Revisit a tree you loved as a child, if you can, or one that looks like it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 343, 'Point out to someone the difference between a tree''s trunk, limbs, branches and twigs on a short walk together.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 344, 'Admire how the bark of a tree you rest near catches the warm light of late afternoon.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 345, 'Ask a friend to describe the most beautiful tree they have ever seen, and share yours in return.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 346, 'Compare a tree standing alone in an open space with trees growing crowded together, and see how their shapes differ.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 347, 'Seek out a fallen log left to rest in a park or woods, and see from the path how moss and small plants grow on it.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 348, 'Flip through a field guide and choose one tree you would like to see in person someday, then look for it nearby.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 349, 'Play a recording of birdsong or wind in the trees while you rest with your eyes closed.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 350, 'Share the care of a balcony or yard tree with someone in your home, taking turns checking its soil.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 351, 'Admire a tree whose bark naturally flakes or curls, without pulling any of it loose.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 352, 'Make your way to a park on a spring afternoon, find a newly planted tree with stakes or a ring of mulch, and imagine how big it may grow.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 353, 'Imagine a single street tree through all four seasons, and say what you think it needs most in each one.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 354, 'Soften your eyes and take in a whole tree at once, rather than any single leaf or branch.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 355, 'Be gentle with low branches on a narrow path, moving them aside slowly instead of pushing through.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 356, 'Pay attention to how a familiar tree looks from a new angle, such as from upstairs, across the street or lying on the grass.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 357, 'Finish a park visit with one last look back at the trees from the gate, picking out the one you will remember.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 358, 'Watch a tree on a frosty morning and wonder how it gets through the cold without its leaves.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 359, 'Hold a pencil loosely and draw a tree with your eyes on the tree, not the page, for one minute.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 360, 'Make peace with a messy tree that drops fruit, sap or seeds near your home by remembering what it gives back.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 361, 'End the day by glancing out at your tree one last time and wishing it a quiet night.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 362, 'Linger on a park bench at the end of summer and listen to the insects buzzing in the branches above.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 363, 'Think back on what you have learned about trees this year and choose the one fact that surprised you most.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 364, 'Write a few lines about the calmest moment you have had near a tree this year.'),
  ('spending-time-among-trees', 365, 'Choose one simple way you will keep caring for the trees near you, and tell someone so it sticks.')
) as v(slug, day, task)
join public.challenge_templates t on t.slug = v.slug;
